eft\">\n  <div\n  class=\"shogun-heading-component\">\n  <h2>\n    \n      Frequently Asked Questions\n    \n  </h2>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div id=\"s-096f9bd2-31ac-464f-80dc-9a6352e540f7\"  class=\"shg-c  \">\n  <div class=\"shogun-accordion-wrapper\" data-multi=\"\">\n  \n    <div class=\"shogun-accordion\">\n      <div class=\"shogun-accordion-heading\">\n        <div class=\"shogun-accordion-header\">\n          <h4 class=\"shogun-accordion-title\">\n            How do oral nicotine pouches work?\n          </h4>\n          \n            <div class=\"shogun-accordion-icon shogun-icon-plus\">\n              <span />\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"shogun-accordion-body\">\n        <div id=\"s-9ff8c7b5-a7a7-4d52-8d47-2645fc310107\"  class=\"shg-c  \">\n  <div\n  class=\"shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content shg-proportional-font-size\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Simple. Pop it under your lip. Feel a slight tingle? That's just the flavour and nicotine starting to release, which is totally normal. After around 30 minutes, just bin it responsibly. No spitting, no mess, no charger needed.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: calc(14px * var(--proportional-font-size) / 100);\">&nbsp;</p></div>\n\n</div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"shogun-accordion\">\n      <div class=\"shogun-accordion-heading\">\n        <div class=\"shogun-accordion-header\">\n          <h4 class=\"shogun-accordion-title\">\n            What nicotine strength should I start with?\n          </h4>\n          \n            <div class=\"shogun-accordion-icon shogun-icon-plus\">\n              <span />\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"shogun-accordion-body\">\n        <div id=\"s-2dd598d4-56f6-44a3-b22c-a2738246c316\"  class=\"shg-c  \">\n  <div\n  class=\"shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content shg-proportional-font-size\"><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">If you're new to pouches or cutting down from smoking, we recommend starting with a low to medium strength like 6mg. You can always adjust later to find the level that works best for you.</span></span></span></p></div>\n\n</div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"shogun-accordion\">\n      <div class=\"shogun-accordion-heading\">\n        <div class=\"shogun-accordion-header\">\n          <h4 class=\"shogun-accordion-title\">\n            How many pouches can I use a day?\n          </h4>\n          \n            <div class=\"shogun-accordion-icon shogun-icon-plus\">\n              <span />\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"shogun-accordion-body\">\n        <div id=\"s-6d65eacf-23c2-4456-8cfc-070f6b357e04\"  class=\"shg-c  \">\n  <div\n  class=\"shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content shg-proportional-font-size\"><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">There's no one-size-fits-all, just listen to your body. Most people use a few throughout the day. Start slow, and adjust depending on what feels right.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></div>\n\n</div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n    <div class=\"shogun-accordion\">\n      <div class=\"shogun-accordion-heading\">\n        <div class=\"shogun-accordion-header\">\n          <h4 class=\"shogun-accordion-title\">\n            What makes your oral nicotine pouches different from other brands?\n          </h4>\n          \n            <div class=\"shogun-accordion-icon shogun-icon-plus\">\n              <span />\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"shogun-accordion-body\">\n        <div id=\"s-35e0c1d4-10a1-4635-bb5e-0d32dc52bc7f\"  class=\"shg-c  \">\n  <div\n  class=\"shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content shg-proportional-font-size\"><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400;\"><spa